- `/tmp/wo/` — downloaded workorder JS chunks: `main.7d5d0431.js` (module `7959` upload, API service defs ~offset 129663), `TicketCreate.22cfeac3.js` (module `93520` ref/atob, module `77723` form/CreateTicket), `609.9d2bee7c.js` (shared conversation renderer, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` x2, `GetSensitiveConversation`), `WorkOrderDetail.ccecc8c5.js` (component `H` plain-text description), `WorkOrderList.ce3bf66f.js`, `AuthorizationList.c85cdb55.js`, `TicketList.f9e55e08.js`, `MobileTicketDetail.e48cad78.js`.
